  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"What is the system and the time within which post\u2011conviction relief can be applied for in California courts? Is there any time limit for filing it with the trial court level?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"Now, after the trial court resolved it and denied relief, then there's no review mechanism other than filing an original writ with the court of appeals?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"So, you -- you can begin in a higher court.\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"But almost always they'll go to the superior court and file a petition. And then in every other State, the losing party would appeal, but in California, they use different words. The words are not you appeal; the words are you file a new petition in the court of appeals.\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"Is that what a majority of courts are holding?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"Do you have to?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"Okay. Then I think perhaps you should cite some authority.\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1b0f78afcf23041ee638f1c8e85eb0fd65471d0468ac1cb81087694ce4b4333c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1b0f78afcf23-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justice: \"Whichever one it is, you have to exhaust those remedies before you apply for Federal habeas.\""
      }
    ],
